g\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xyN0hmi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">「合併附魔」是一個<strong>伺服端</strong>模組，讓你可以混合、排除甚至合併所有附魔。例如：鋒利、不死剋星和節肢剋星、所有類型的保護（火焰、爆炸和投射物）、絲綢之觸與幸運、波濤與忠誠/喚雷、密度、破甲、不死剋星和節肢剋星。請查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>了解如何設定配置，你可以建立<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑名單</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">合併所有附魔</a>。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/H9nhuOr.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/l717aDK.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"234\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：它能與其他模組的附魔一起使用嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：自v3.0起，可以合併所有原版和外部模組的附魔。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何同時獲得<span style=\"color:#008000\">絲綢之觸</span>和<span style=\"color:#9c0\">幸運</span>？</strong><br>答：你需要安裝「合併附魔」和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toggle-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Toggle Enchantments</a><br><strong>問：如何同時獲得<span style=\"color:#36f\">波濤</span>、<span style=\"color:#f60\">忠誠</span>和<span style=\"color:#fc0\">喚雷</span>？</strong><br>答：你需要安裝「合併附魔」和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-trident-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Improved Trident Enchantments</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：這是客戶端還是伺服端模組？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：自v4.2起，此模組僅為伺服端。<br><strong>問：我可以將「合併附魔」包含在我的模組包中嗎？</strong><br>答：當然，只需將我的模組放入相關專案中即可。</span></li>\n</ul>",
